      *################################################################*02550000
      *                                                                *02560000
      * Prep av data som skal logges                                   *02570000
      *                                                                *02580000
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*02590000
       D000-Prepare-Data                 Section.                       02600000
      *                                                                 02610000
      *    Vi flytter over input feltene                                02620000
      *                                                                 02630000
      * SEC-002/SEC-006 (CWE-532/CWE-319): every caller of this shared
      * trace subprogram (FTFRH120 among others) ends up PUT1-ing
      * R791TRAC-In-Trace-Data unencrypted to the FDPO.TRACELOG MQ queue.
      * When the trace area is 'R400CH01' (the STG session header,
      * copybooks/R400CH02.copy), mask the session-identity bytes at
      * their fixed offsets within that record: R400CH01-Terminalid is
      * bytes 43-50 and R400CH01-Userid is bytes 51-58 (both Pic X(08),
      * confirmed against copybooks/R400CH02.copy:42-44 by summing the
      * preceding fields' widths). Fixed here, once, rather than at each
      * of FTFRH120's 4 call sites, so every current and future caller of
      * F791TRAC is covered - this file carries no "must not be modified
      * by human hands" restriction, unlike FTFRH120.src.
      * REVIEWER: this masks session identity only. The RTFRE120 business
      * payload (contract numbers, amounts, paying-party name, moved in
      * under trace area 'RTFRE120') is NOT masked here - full remediation
      * needs the field-level redaction/allow-list redesign recommended
      * in SECURITY_FINDINGS.md, which is a larger change than this
      * reference-modification mask. Re-verify the byte offsets above
      * against your shop's actual R400CH02 copybook before applying - a
      * future copybook reorder would silently make this mask wrong.
           If  R791TRAC-In-Trace-Area  In  R791TRAC-Interface
                                        =   'R400CH01'
           Move  Spaces            To  R791TRAC-In-Trace-Data
                                        In R791TRAC-Interface (43:16)
           End-If
           Move  R791TRAC-In-Program     In    R791TRAC-Interface       02640000
                                         To    R791DBGH-Program         02650000
           Move  R791TRAC-In-Sysid       In    R791TRAC-Interface       02660000
                                         To    R791DBGH-Sysid           02670000
           Move  R791TRAC-In-Trace-Point In    R791TRAC-Interface       02680000
                                         To    R791DBGH-Trace-Point     02690000
           Move  R791TRAC-In-Trace-Area  In    R791TRAC-Interface       02700000
                                         To    R791DBGH-Trace-Area      02710000
      *                                                                 02720000
      *    Vi finner lengden p� fritekst dataomr�det                    02730000
      *                                                                 02740000
           Initialize                          R7919310-Streng          02750000
           Set   R7919310-Versjon        To    True                     02760000
           Set   R7919310-In-Length      To    True                     02770000
           Move  R791TRAC-In-Trace-Data  In    R791TRAC-Interface       02780000
                                         To    R7919310-In-Streng       02790000
           Move  Length                  Of    R791TRAC-In-Trace-Data   02800000
                                         In    R791TRAC-Interface       02810000
                                         To    R7919310-In-Lengde       02820000
           Call  'F7919310'              Using R7919310-Streng          02830000
                                               R7919999-Error           02840000
           End-Call                                                     02850000
                                                                        02860000
           If  R7919999-Retur-Abend                                     02870000
               Move  'C001'              To    R7919999-Paragraf        02880000
               Perform Z900-Abend                                       02890000
           End-If                                                       02900000
      *                                                                 02910000
      *    Vi bygger dataomr�det som skal logges                        02920000
      *                                                                 02930000
           Move  R791DBGH-Trace-Info-Hdr To    W-Trace-Area             02940000
           Move  R791TRAC-In-Trace-Data  In    R791TRAC-interface       02950001
                                         To    W-Trace-Area ( Length    02960001
                                         Of    R791DBGH-Trace-Info-Hdr  02970000
                                         +     1 : R7919310-Ut-Lengde)  02980000
           Compute  W-I-Len              =     R7919310-Ut-Lengde       02990001
                                         +     Length                   03000001
                                         Of    R791DBGH-Trace-Info-Hdr  03010001
           End-Compute                                                  03020001
           .                                                            03030000
      *                                                                 03040000
       D000-Prepare-Data-Ex.                                            03050000
           Exit.                                                        03060000
